{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life 2047: Escape Simulator</strong> is an atmospheric game with elements of arcade and stealth, set in a cyberpunk dystopia. Here, every step forward is a struggle against a system that watches, punishes, and repeats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning \u2014 the same room. The same line. The same faces. You move forward, but it feels like you're standing still. What is this? A simulation? A punishment? Or part of someone\u2019s plan?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LINE AS CORE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance, earn points, and use them to get closer to the exit. Every step costs resources. Every hesitation might cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/1171499de08c1ca6a2067b28b325cb8f.poster.avif?t=1756272383\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/1171499de08c1ca6a2067b28b325cb8f.webm?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/1171499de08c1ca6a2067b28b325cb8f.mp4?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINI-GAMES THAT OFFER A CHANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack the system, solve puzzles, pass reaction-based challenges \u2014 each success may break the loop\u2026 or trigger retaliation. Follow instructions or disrupt the order? Obey or resist? <br>Every choice affects the world and brings you closer to one of several endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/6e2c5c9370d8ba041e75ec1809f17813.poster.avif?t=1756272383\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/6e2c5c9370d8ba041e75ec1809f17813.webm?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/6e2c5c9370d8ba041e75ec1809f17813.mp4?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVEILLANCE AND CONTROL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cameras, drones, enforcer bots \u2014 the system sees everything. Any deviation from the pattern is dangerous. Stay unnoticed if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/b893ce5edb68e86ead7ace3b7f945e1e.poster.avif?t=1756272383\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/b893ce5edb68e86ead7ace3b7f945e1e.webm?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/b893ce5edb68e86ead7ace3b7f945e1e.mp4?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD OF SOVIET CYBERPUNK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panel buildings, endless bureaucratic corridors, flickering terminals, and public announcements echoing from the past. Only this past now belongs to machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/9796ad40b98c8ace6a3fd9579cd8732e.poster.avif?t=1756272383\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/9796ad40b98c8ace6a3fd9579cd8732e.webm?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/9796ad40b98c8ace6a3fd9579cd8732e.mp4?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STORY FILLED WITH SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system leaves traces \u2014 codes, encrypted messages, interface glitches, fragments of dialogue. All of it part of a larger puzzle that only you can solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.poster.avif?t=1756272383\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.webm?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.mp4?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the first to be trapped in this world. But maybe \u2014 just maybe \u2014 you'll be the last.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676100?t=1756272383","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676100?t=1756272383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/0d11ff1f9f0b0fbf370c9768587bdff683ac782d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756272383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/0d11ff1f9f0b0fbf370c9768587bdff683ac782d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756272383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life 2047: Escape Simulator</strong> is an atmospheric game with elements of arcade and stealth, set in a cyberpunk dystopia. Here, every step forward is a struggle against a system that watches, punishes, and repeats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning \u2014 the same room. The same line. The same faces. You move forward, but it feels like you're standing still. What is this? A simulation? A punishment? Or part of someone\u2019s plan?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LINE AS CORE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance, earn points, and use them to get closer to the exit. Every step costs resources. Every hesitation might cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/1171499de08c1ca6a2067b28b325cb8f.poster.avif?t=1756272383\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/1171499de08c1ca6a2067b28b325cb8f.webm?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/1171499de08c1ca6a2067b28b325cb8f.mp4?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINI-GAMES THAT OFFER A CHANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack the system, solve puzzles, pass reaction-based challenges \u2014 each success may break the loop\u2026 or trigger retaliation. Follow instructions or disrupt the order? Obey or resist? <br>Every choice affects the world and brings you closer to one of several endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/6e2c5c9370d8ba041e75ec1809f17813.poster.avif?t=1756272383\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/6e2c5c9370d8ba041e75ec1809f17813.webm?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/6e2c5c9370d8ba041e75ec1809f17813.mp4?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVEILLANCE AND CONTROL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cameras, drones, enforcer bots \u2014 the system sees everything. Any deviation from the pattern is dangerous. Stay unnoticed if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/b893ce5edb68e86ead7ace3b7f945e1e.poster.avif?t=1756272383\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/b893ce5edb68e86ead7ace3b7f945e1e.webm?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/b893ce5edb68e86ead7ace3b7f945e1e.mp4?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD OF SOVIET CYBERPUNK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panel buildings, endless bureaucratic corridors, flickering terminals, and public announcements echoing from the past. Only this past now belongs to machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/9796ad40b98c8ace6a3fd9579cd8732e.poster.avif?t=1756272383\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/9796ad40b98c8ace6a3fd9579cd8732e.webm?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/9796ad40b98c8ace6a3fd9579cd8732e.mp4?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STORY FILLED WITH SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system leaves traces \u2014 codes, encrypted messages, interface glitches, fragments of dialogue. All of it part of a larger puzzle that only you can solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.poster.avif?t=1756272383\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.webm?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.mp4?t=1756272383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the first to be trapped in this world. But maybe \u2014 just maybe \u2014 you'll be the last.</p>","developers":["Axionity"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/98c8bacc79e42eb4565c1d1ca6d42280881fde42/header.jpg?t=1756272383","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<